One representative of the employees of the University (other than teacher) to be elected in the manner prescribed;
(21)
Two farmers to be nominated by the Chancellor;
(22)
Two eminent Agricultural Scientists to be nominated by the Chancellor;
(23)
Two eminent Scientists (other than Agricultural Scientist) to be nominated by the Chancellor;
(24)
One meritorious student to be nominated by the Vice-Chancellor in the manner prescribed by the Statutes;
(25)
